{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1210708001:0":{"text":"辛巴达，水耗子是什么意思？你为什么对水鬼帮的事这么了解？","source_cn":"辛巴达，水耗子是什么意思？你为什么对水鬼帮的事这么了解？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9324F2D1A6684EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210708002:0":{"text":"抓水耗子就是抓血薇帮的间谍，血薇帮也想派人渗透水鬼帮的。","source_cn":"抓水耗子就是抓血薇帮的间谍，血薇帮也想派人渗透水鬼帮的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F98995556DB2214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210708003:0":{"text":"你卖了多少血薇帮的弟兄？","source_cn":"你卖了多少血薇帮的弟兄？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00CE7D39B22B60FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210708004:0":{"text":"别瞪我，我不仅没卖，还放了不少。","source_cn":"别瞪我，我不仅没卖，还放了不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C46D01B364A61E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210708005:0":{"text":"难道你们以为我帮水鬼办事，就是为了钱？","source_cn":"难道你们以为我帮水鬼办事，就是为了钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7AEF6BB71C0217C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210708006:0":{"text":"嘿，那我为什么连他们的营地分布，成员来源，日常爱干什么，上贡要什么鱼，都摸清了？？","source_cn":"嘿，那我为什么连他们的营地分布，成员来源，日常爱干什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D141C27DD358B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210708007:0":{"text":"我等的就是把他们连根拔起的这一天呢！","source_cn":"我等的就是把他们连根拔起的这一天呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E02008B2CE1649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210708008:0":{"text":"干得不错，你知道水鬼会把泰西欧藏在哪里吗？","source_cn":"干得不错，你知道水鬼会把泰西欧藏在哪里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEEB2F5457B78C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210708009:0":{"text":"以泰西欧的性格，肯定不愿意在野外和水鬼挤帐篷……","source_cn":"以泰西欧的性格，肯定不愿意在野外和水鬼挤帐篷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF135287BDFFD58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210708010:0":{"text":"泰西欧应该在<style=\"highlight\">枷锁号</style>上躲着。","source_cn":"泰西欧应该在<style=highlight>枷锁号<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1090E44303C2B809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210708011:0":{"text":"枷锁号是水鬼帮的大船，而且是可以和死潮舰队的不死号媲美的大船！听说他们的老大和头目会在那上面待着。","source_cn":"枷锁号是水鬼帮的大船，而且是可以和死潮舰队的不死号媲美...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75DBA6F3D6104152","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"枷锁号是水鬼帮的大船，而且是可以和死潮舰队的不死号媲美的大船！听说他们的老大和头目会在那上面待着。","female":"枷锁号是水鬼帮的大船，而且是可以和死潮舰队的不死号媲美的大船！听说他们的老大和头目会在那上面待着。","variant_male_record_index":"131210","variant_female_record_index":"131211","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210708012:0":{"text":"说不定除了泰西欧，我们还能见到奈拉。","source_cn":"说不定除了泰西欧，我们还能见到奈拉。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x257AFB4661D1EE51","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"说不定除了泰西欧，我们还能见到奈拉。","female":"说不定除了泰西欧，我们还能见到奈拉。","variant_male_record_index":"131212","variant_female_record_index":"131213","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210708013:0":{"text":"很好，这趟突袭，有你在，事半功倍。","source_cn":"很好，这趟突袭，有你在，事半功倍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB753ED38BCCBDE63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210708014:0":{"text":"带路吧！","source_cn":"带路吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A17FE260623BD3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"辛巴达","source":"辛巴达","status":"source"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"索尼娅","source":"索尼娅","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}